  "question": {
    "text": "The total number of amines among the following which can be synthesized by Gabriel synthesis is ________.<p><img src=\"assets\\qt0143_a475c2a06cf7.png\" style=\"width: 339px; height: 125px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Gabriel phthalimide synthesis is used to prepare <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> aliphatic/alicyclic amine in common.</p><p>Hence, amine which can synthesised by Gabriel phthalimide synthesis method is:</p><p>(A)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Me</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>CH</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>(B)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>(C)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ph</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p>"
  }
